[559.592912, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mnosedive preflight\r\n== bridge status ==\r\nnosedive-workspace: /tmp/nosedive-cast/BASE/workspace\r\nnosedive-compatibility-level: 2\r\nnosedive-bridge-freshness: HEAD 89d2a51 matches origin/main 89d2a51\r\n\r\n== pilot identification ==\r\nnosedive-pilot-name: Dan Stace\r\nnosedive-pilot-email: dstace@gmail.com\r\n\r\n== feats and their dives ==\r\n\r\n## [Add A Hello Note](kb/01a05d3f-56a3-7330-a9a0-22e322f2821f.md)\r\n\r\n- kb/01a05d3f-654d-7db7-a01a-2571bc17246d.md: Add a hello note to the bridge -- needs=diver logged 3 minutes ago\r\n\r\nIf any line above starts with `nose:`, alert the pilot before taking action.\r\nIf the pilot wants to work on something specific, start with `nosedive jump <doc-path>`.\r\nOtherwise, suggest they address something that has `needs`.\r\nIf nothing needs to be done right now, start a free dive with `nosedive record.dive --free`, then help the pilot choose a feat.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[664.729039, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mnosedive jump kb/01a05d3f-654d-7db7-a01a-2571bc17246d.md\r\nhydrated repo=01a05d3f-436d-7833-b57f-694865f2f937 path=workspace/__self\r\njump: BASE is pinned 4 commits behind main; re-pin with `npx -y nosedive@2026.9.1 record.dive --ref 01a05d3f-654d-7db7-a01a-2571bc17246d --repin`\r\njumped dive 01a05d3f-654d-7db7-a01a-2571bc17246d: applied 1 artifact(s)\r\n\r\nRead the dive at kb/01a05d3f-654d-7db7-a01a-2571bc17246d.md in full and get the gist of its links.\r\nRead the feat it serves at kb/01a05d3f-56a3-7330-a9a0-22e322f2821f.md\r\nThen follow the dive's ## Brief section.\r\nAny notes below were logged by prior divers; use for added context.\r\n\r\nCommit completed work in these repos, and nowhere else:\r\n- workspace/__self (kb name: BASE) -- work branch work/add-a-hello-note\r\n\r\nAs you progress, use `nosedive append-log.dive` to record what you did, and what you think is next.\r\nDo not edit the brief or change any scopes.\r\nWhen done, leave the work in place for the pilot to review. \r\nDo not run `nosedive land` unless you have been directly instructed to.\r\nScratch space for this dive: workspace/.scratch/01a05d3f-654d-7db7-a01a-2571bc17246d/ Write temp files there, never /tmp. It is local only; pack will not capture it.\r\n"]
